  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<pre>This file contains the neuroevolution potential (NEP) models and datasets used in the paper \"Atomic armor for thermal stability in nanoporous structures\" published in [Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences of the United States of America (PNAS)]. Note that nep.in, nep.txt, and train.xyz contains the specific parameters used to obtain the NEP model, the NEP model itself, and the dataset used, respectively.</pre><p><br></p>",
